        "spya-jjfbqh",
        "spya-dxzfn8"
      ],
      "title": "Law, Character, and Business",
      "gist": "Phrenology clarifies degrees of guilt in law, explains the excesses behind crime and business failure, and points toward the balanced exercise of faculties needed for happiness and success."
    },
    "n0076": {
      "id": "n0076",
      "depth": 2,
