      "range": [
        "spya-jjfbqh",
        "spya-jjfbqh"
      ],
      "title": "Legitimate and Perverted Faculties",
      "gist": "Using the railway speculator Hudson as an example, faculties like Acquisitiveness are shown to be good when balanced but destructive when excessive."
    },
